<title>USA: HomeCorp Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>HomeCorp Inc Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKFORD, Ill. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.64   profit	$ 0.23</p>
<p> Net loss		     756   profit	   278</p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.01   profit	 $0.76</p>
<p> Net profit		    10   profit	   892</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results include one-time Savings Association Insurance Fund charge that reduced quarterly earnings by $1.2 million after tax. Excluding the SAIF assessment, 1996 results were a profit of $489,827 or $0.41/shr in the Q3 and profit of $1.3 million or $1.06/shr for the nine months.</p>
